+# Password Hashing
+
+This project's current recorded decision is to use **argon2id** for password hashing, adopted for its better security properties. This value was confirmed by the `config/decisions/revoke-password-hashing.json` record (commit 6828152); that file was later relocated out of the repository tree (commit 164b404), but no subsequent decision has changed or revoked the chosen algorithm, so argon2id remains the current policy.
